Package: paretoinfer
Title: Sequential Identification of Approximately Pareto-Optimal
        Alternatives under Noise
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("André", "Leite", , "leite@castlab.org", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4718-9766"))
Description: Sequential elimination and identification of
 epsilon-Pareto-optimal alternatives among a finite set with noisy,
 correlated objectives. Simultaneous confidence sequences for objective
 differences, plausible Pareto sets, certified dominance and adaptive
 choice of the next evaluation.
License: GPL (>= 3)
